  "id": "fig-choice-n19-slopes",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "One shared collection of four separately framed panels. A: y=x/5, passing (0,0),(5,1). B: y=-x/3, passing (0,0),(3,-1). C: y=5x, passing (0,0),(1,5). D: y=x/3, passing (0,0),(3,1). All panel axes must use identical scales and aspect. A and B implement the requested formulas; C and D are deliberate alternatives. Used by one multiple question selecting every matching graph. Four new frames, option labels A/B/C/D and numeric axes; no printed function formulas. These are not subfigures in fig-77.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "One shared collection of four separately framed panels. A: y=x/5, passing (0,0),(5,1). B: y=-x/3, passing (0,0),(3,-1). C: y=5x, passing (0,0),(1,5). D: y=x/3, passing (0,0),(3,1). All panel axes must use identical scales and aspect. A and B implement the requested formulas; C and D are deliberate alternatives. Used by one multiple question selecting every matching graph. C: replace slope 0.2=1/5 by its reciprocal 5, reversing rise/run. D: discard the minus sign from -x/3 to obtain x/3. Four new frames, option labels A/B/C/D and numeric axes; no printed function formulas. These are not subfigures in fig-77. This is newly authored mathematics, not a recovered original. Figure 77 was visually inspected only for general axes styling and is not provenance. Numeric scales, plotting windows and panel layout are deliberate authored additions. No formula is printed on the graph.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n19",
        "exercise": "303",
        "text": "作下列各式给出的函数的图象：\na) $y=0.2x$；\nb) $y=-\\frac{1}{3}x$。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n19",
        "text": "可以用式 $y=kx+l$（其中 $k$ 和 $l$ 是两个数）给出的函数，叫做线性函数。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n19",
        "text": "因为式 $kx+l$ 对于任何 $x$ 值都有意义，所以线性函数的定义域可以是所有数的集合，也可以是它的任一子集。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n19",
        "text": "以前学过的正比例关系是线性函数的特殊情况。\n这是因为当 $l=0$ 和 $k\\ne0$ 时，式 $y=kx+l$ 变形为 $y=kx$。\n我们知道，这个式子（当 $k\\ne0$ 时）给出的是正比例关系。"
      }
    ],
